  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T X.1277 describes the FIDO universal authentication framework (UAF) that enables online services and websites, whether on the open Internet or within enterprises, to transparently leverage native security features of end-user computing devices for strong user authentication and to reduce the problems associated with creating and remembering many online credentials. </abstract>
